您不得超出许可范围实施商业使用，不得未经许可方书面授权出售、转让、出租或再许可商业授权、授权凭证或许可证本身，也不得声称有权代表许可方签发商业授权。
You may not engage in commercial use beyond the licensed scope, sell, transfer, rent, or sublicense a commercial authorization, entitlement credential, or the license itself without Licensor's written authorization, or claim authority to issue commercial licenses on Licensor's behalf.

您不得删除、篡改或隐匿软件及随附文件中的版权、许可和来源声明，或将第三方代码冒称为独立原创。依法或依第三方许可证保留的权利不受本条限制。
You may not remove, falsify, or conceal copyright, license, or attribution notices in the Software and accompanying materials, or misrepresent third-party code as original work. Rights preserved by mandatory law or third-party licenses are unaffected.

未明确授予的权利由相应权利人保留。本许可证不授予商标、商号或标识的独立使用许可，也不授权以许可方或上游项目名义作出背书。
All rights not expressly granted are reserved by their respective holders. This License grants no independent license to trademarks, trade names, or logos, and no authority to claim endorsement by Licensor or upstream projects.

