7. 终止与既有许可 / Termination and existing licenses

严重违反本许可证时，许可方可书面通知终止本许可证项下授权。对可补救违约，许可方给予通知送达后30日的补救期；逾期未补救时终止。未经授权的商业使用在取得授权前应立即停止，补救期不产生临时商业许可。终止后停止依赖本许可证使用和分发软件，并删除或返还受其覆盖的副本，法律要求保存的存档除外。第三方许可及他人依法取得的独立许可不因此终止。
Licensor may terminate the grant under this License by written notice for material breach. For a remediable breach, Licensor allows 30 days after delivery of notice to cure; termination takes effect if uncured. Unauthorized commercial use must stop immediately until licensed; a cure period grants no temporary commercial permission. Upon termination, cease use and distribution under this License and delete or return covered copies, except archives required by law. Third-party licenses and others' independently and lawfully obtained licenses are unaffected.

此前依法根据 MIT 或其他许可证获得的软件副本及相应权利，继续按该原许可证适用。本许可证不追溯撤销或限制这些权利，也不改变第三方代码的原许可。
Copies and corresponding rights previously and lawfully obtained under MIT or another license remain governed by that original license. This License does not retroactively revoke or restrict those rights or change original licenses for third-party code.

